==Battleground==
*1 [[Gabriel]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*3 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup> delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup> delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Boraphim]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**15 [[Mr. Angel]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
**5 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**1 [[Angelic Sleipnir]] spawns.

==Strategy==
The Boraphim is easily controlled by your Ubers or [[Farmboy Cat]], and walled by [[Ramen Cat]]. Spam your units and you win.

